msgstr "用量读取"

msgid "Use 'defer' to archive without deleting; that keeps records"
msgstr "想留下记录就用「不做了」封存，那个不删"

msgid "Use draft"
msgstr "用草稿"

msgid "Use this only if you can't reopen an old PR on GitHub. Use when the branch has been force-pushed or deleted: it will re-open using the current branch and rejoin the merge queue."
msgstr "能在 GitHub 上重开旧 PR 就不用这个。分支被强推或删过才用：会用当前分支重提一个，回到合入队列。"

msgid "Use when the container is stuck, missing dependencies, or credentials changed. The next turn will re-clone and reinstall; the branch in the host repo stays."
msgstr "容器卡住、少挂了东西、或换过凭据时用。下一个 turn 重新 clone + 装依赖，分支在宿主仓库里不会丢"

msgid "Used when a project has not set its own"
msgstr "没自己设的项目用这些"

