msgstr "分量："

msgid "What"
msgstr "在做什么"

msgid "What the agents write in. Code, commits, branches, PRs and errors stay English. Changing it restarts every session."
msgstr "agent 用什么语言写。代码、commit、分支名、PR 和错误信息始终是英文。改这一项会重启每一个 session。"

msgid "What this browser reads. What the agents write is the output language, under Models & budget — and this follows it unless you pick one here."
msgstr "这台机器读什么语言。agent 写什么语言是「对外语言」，在 模型与预算 里——没在这里单独选的话，这里就跟着它走。"

msgid "What's not satisfactory. Cmd+Enter to reject"
msgstr "哪里不满意。⌘Enter 退回"

msgid "When the limit is reached, the group pauses until you decide whether to increase it."
msgstr "用满就挂起，等你决定加不加。"

msgid "When the same thing surfaces N times, it should be a project rule, not the N+1-th complaint."
msgstr "同一件事说到第 N 次，它就该是项目的一条规则，而不是第 N+1 次抱怨。"

msgid "Where opensandbox-server lives. Must be dns+nft mode or credential injection silently fails. Doesn't have to be this machine—Tailscale peer or cloud machine, SDK only talks HTTP."
msgstr "opensandbox-server 在哪。必须是 dns+nft 模式，否则凭据注入静默失效。它不一定在这台机器上——Tailscale 上的一台或者一台云机器都行，SDK 只跟它说 HTTP。"

msgid "Which model handles each difficulty, per CLI. Which role uses which CLI is in roles/*.yaml. Only affects newly hired agents — a model is frozen at hire time."
msgstr "每种难度用哪个模型，按 CLI 分。哪个角色用哪个 CLI 在 roles/*.yaml 里。只对新雇的 agent 生效——模型在雇佣时就定死了。"

msgid "Which model runs what, and what it may spend"
msgstr "哪个模型跑什么，能花多少"

msgid "Which tiers skip your final look after passing all four gates. Trivial and normal by default; hard still waits for you."
msgstr "过了全部四道闸之后，哪些档位跳过你最后那一眼。默认 trivial 和 normal；hard 仍然等你。"

msgid "Which window"
msgstr "看的是哪一段"

msgid "Who · Model"
msgstr "谁 · 模型"

msgid "Why this value"
msgstr "为什么是这个值"

msgid "Will be read at the start of the next turn. Paste screenshots directly; / to insert a skill. Cmd+Enter to send to PM"
msgstr "下一个 turn 开头就会读到。截图直接粘，/ 插技能路径。⌘Enter 发给 PM"

